"view.researchprojectinputscreen.help.text"           = "Enter the name of the project; this name must not already be in use. You can also add a description, but this is not required.\n\nEnigma supports nine types of research. Make your choice from the drop-down list under 'Inquiry type'.\n\nEnigma always creates a control group. With smaller datasets it can be wise to use a multiplier for the control group. A multiplier of 10 with 2030 records gives a control group of 20300 items.\n\nUnder 'Project folder' choose a folder in which to save the results. Enigma creates a subfolder with the name of your project inside that folder.\n\nOnce you have filled in everything, click 'Next' to open the project configuration screen.";

