"view.researchprojectconfigscreen.help.text"                = "Select the factors to include in this research project. At least one factor must be selected.\n\nFor 'Factors in houses' you can also choose the house system to use.\n\nFor 'Aspects' select which aspects to include and optionally override the default orb from your configuration.\n\nFor 'Midpoints' select which dials to use (360°, 90°, 45°) and the orb per dial.\n\nFor 'Harmonics' enter the harmonic number (must be 2 or higher) and optionally override the default orb.\n\nFor 'Unaspected', 'Parallels', and 'Declination Midpoints' you can optionally override the default orb.\n\nWhen you have configured everything, click 'Save' to create the project.";
